#: ../../source/user-guide/data-processing.md:139
#: 0ffcf167306644b48a8e36eee62445ee
msgid "题目序列 vs 技能序列的差异："
msgstr "Differences between question sequences and skill sequences:"

#: ../../source/user-guide/data-processing.md:141
#: e66b4b12fe464a80931acca98e33f920
msgid ""
"+--------------+-----------------------+----------------------------------------+"
" | 类型         | 粒度                  | 用途"
"                                   | "
"+==============+=======================+========================================+"
" | **题目序列** | 一次交互 = 一个时间步 | 预测特定题目的表现                     | "
"+--------------+-----------------------+----------------------------------------+"
" | **技能序列** | 一个技能 = 一个时间步 | 预测技能掌握度（多技能题目展开为多行） | "
"+--------------+-----------------------+----------------------------------------+"
msgstr ""
"+-----------------------+---------------------------------+-------------------"
"----------------------------------------------------+ | Type                  "
"| Granularity                     | Purpose                                   "
"                            | +=======================+======================="
"==========+==================================================================="
"====+ | **Question sequence** | One interaction = one time step | Predict perf"
"ormance on a specific question                            | +-----------------"
"------+---------------------------------+-------------------------------------"
"----------------------------------+ | **Skill sequence**    | One skill = one "
"time step       | Predict skill mastery (multi-skill questions expand to multi"
"ple rows) | +-----------------------+---------------------------------+-------"
"----------------------------------------------------------------+"

#: ../../source/user-guide/data-processing.md:149
#: 175fb9bd51d14c59b41d2543d8a1a10c
msgid "对于多技能题目（例如标记了技能 ``2``、``37``、``70`` 的题目）："
msgstr ""
"For multi-skill questions (e.g., a question tagged with skills ``2``, ``37``, "
"``70``):"

#: ../../source/user-guide/data-processing.md:151
#: 9310892635414cbcac5291de3fe2d7a2
msgid "**题目序列**：单条目，``question=123``"
msgstr "**Question sequence**: Single entry, ``question=123``"

#: ../../source/user-guide/data-processing.md:152
#: 7d5c9a057c634109a076b73e4ffb8b2b
msgid "**技能序列**：三条记录，``skill=[2, 37, 70]``，``question=123``，``label`` 和其他字段相同"
msgstr ""
"**Skill sequence**: Three records, ``skill=[2, 37, 70]``, ``question=123``, wi"
"th ``label`` and other fields identical"

#: ../../source/user-guide/data-processing.md:154
#: 28f71dc10c464fdeb152d25dcc05f1c5
msgid "技能序列保留了 ``question`` 列，因此需要题目 ID（如 AKT Rasch）的模型可以直接使用。"
msgstr ""
"The skill sequence retains the ``question`` column, so models that need questi"
"on IDs (e.g., AKT Rasch) can use it directly."

